---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { company } from '../data/company';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Vivify Signage Coimbatore"
  description="Learn about Vivify Signage, leading LED & Glow Sign Boards manufacturer in Coimbatore. Discover our architectural ACP elevation craftsmanship and fabrication facilities."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden  bg-[#07090e]">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-grid-pattern opacity-30"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 right-1/3 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]/10 blur-[130px]"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#f59e0b]/30 bg-[#f59e0b]/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold font-semibold text-[#f59e0b]">
        Our Heritage & Facilities
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        Crafting Architectural Signage Since 2015
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Based in Ganapathy, Coimbatore, Vivify Signage is a dedicated fabrication house transforming ordinary retail storefronts and corporate headquarters into illuminated architectural landmarks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Narrative & Philosophy Section -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-[#090b10]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        
        <!-- Left Media Collage -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#1e283d] overflow-hidden aspect-[4/5] bg-[#0c101a]">
              <img
                src="/images/signage/1000504400.jpg"
                alt="ACP Elevation Cladding by Vivify Signage"
                class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4 pt-6">
              <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#1e283d] overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-[#0c101a]">
                <img
                  src="/images/signage/1000504406.jpg"
                  alt="In-house CNC Router and laser station"
                  class="h-full w-full object-cover"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#1e283d] p-6 bg-[#0e1320] space-y-2">
                <span class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#f59e0b]">500+</span>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold font-semibold text-white">Installed Facades</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Retail chains, hospitals, and tech campuses across Tamil Nadu.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Story & Philosophy -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold font-semibold text-slate-300">
            About Company
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
            VIVIFY SIGNAGE: Leaders in LED & Glow Sign Boards in Coimbatore
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              ACP Exterior Finishing is the critical touch that elevates the look of a structure. It involves the meticulous application of Aluminum Composite Panels to create a polished and cohesive exterior, adding sophistication and stature to architectural design.
            </p>
            <p>
              Branding your office space directly affects your deals and market perception. Most business owners understand that inviting people into an office that showcases a brand without having to say a word is an immediate way to reinforce dedication and expertise. It helps guests see what is possible, increasing your chances of sealing the deal.
            </p>
            <p>
              It also appears in team pride. When your space is aesthetically commanding, it underpins group strategy and conjures imagination. It creates an environment that your team and your customers are proud to be a piece of, boosting team morale and the stream of ideas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4  flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200">
              <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]"></span>
              <span>Fully In-House Manufacturing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200">
              <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]"></span>
              <span>Samsung & MeanWell Certified Components</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200">
              <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b]"></span>
              <span>Turnkey Rigging & Structural Support</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4-Step Engineering & Delivery Workflow -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-[#07090e] ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#f59e0b]/30 bg-[#f59e0b]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold font-semibold text-[#f59e0b]">
          The Workflow
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          How We Bring Architectural Signs to Life
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
          From the initial on-site physical measurement to final illuminated rigging, every project is handled end-to-end.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0c101a] p-6 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Site Survey & Blueprint</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Our engineers visit your location in Coimbatore or Tamil Nadu, measuring elevation angles, electrical provisions, structural wind loads, and line-of-sight visibility.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0c101a] p-6 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">CAD & Material Choice</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            We draft precise daylight and night illumination simulations, helping you pick between 3D Liquid Letters, Halo-lit Acrylic, or ACP Facade panelling.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0c101a] p-6 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Precision In-House Build</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            CNC router channel grooving, laser-polished acrylic edge finishing, and high-efficiency IP67 LED wiring performed within our Ganapathy workshop.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#0c101a] p-6 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">On-Site Rigging & Power-Up</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Our certified structural rigging crew anchors the framework securely with weather-sealed conduits, followed by comprehensive night luminescence testing.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#0c101a] ">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 text-center md:text-left">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white">
          Ready to Elevate Your Building's Physical Identity?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">
          Visit our Ganapathy workshop or talk to our signage engineering team for a free on-site survey.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
        <a
          href={company.whatsappLink}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-xl bg-[#25D366] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-bold font-semibold text-black  hover:bg-[#20ba59] transition-all"
        >
          Chat on WhatsApp
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="rounded-xl bg-[#f59e0b] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-bold font-semibold text-black hover:bg-[#fbbf24] transition-all"
        >
          Contact Office
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
